+# PixaCut getting started
+
+This is a modified GPL edition of Nuzky. The native app is not yet verified or published.
+
+1. Create a project using vertical format for Reels/Shorts or landscape for longer videos.
+2. Import your own video/audio and arrange clips on the timeline. Trim and split; use Undo to reverse edits.
+3. Generate captions after downloading the local Whisper model. Review every word and its timing.
+4. Adjust text, audio and effects, preview the whole result, and save the project.
+5. Export into a new video file. Preserve original media; projects reference their files.
+
+Settings > General contains the PixaCut quick guide, the retained built-in guided tour and GPL attribution. Provider AI features require your own account/model setup. Pixa suite activation and a publisher-owned updater are not connected in this prototype.
